# pip-audit, the dependency audit audit.yml runs; it audits this file's own
# tree with the rest. Pinned so a tool release cannot turn CI red on an
# unchanged commit. Compiled into requirements-pip-audit.txt with hashes on
# Python 3.11, for the reason requirements-dev.in gives:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes requirements-pip-audit.in
# pip, which pip-api needs, stays out of the lock: the runner's pip
# satisfies it, so installing the auditor never replaces the installer.
pip-audit==2.10.1
